From 62307bd3946a42510cf62c486fcbb553d9fe56e0 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: proshiv85-byte <proshiv85@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 12:56:10 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] WallpaperPicker2: add a blur option when setting a static
 wallpaper

The apply wallpaper screen gets a "Blur wallpaper" switch, shown for
static wallpapers. While it is on, the previews are blurred with a
RenderEffect, and the wallpaper is blurred at full resolution before it
is set. The strength is relative to the visible width, so the preview
and the result match.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I38bc7ac0e7987fe13b68dd328e405bec03fe4bdb
